MASTER IMPLEMENTATION PROMPT — IT ASSET VAULT MULTI-TENANT SaaS PLATFORM

PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Upgrade my existing IT Asset Vault application into a production-ready, commercial, multi-tenant SaaS platform for IT Asset Management (ITAM), IT Helpdesk and IT Service Management (ITSM).

The application must support two customer categories:

1. Companies and organisations managing their own IT assets, employees, departments, locations and IT support operations.
2. IT service providers and Managed Service Providers (MSPs) managing multiple client organisations from one central dashboard.

The business model must support shared SaaS subscriptions for normal customers and optional dedicated Enterprise deployments.

IMPORTANT: DO NOT RECREATE THE APPLICATION FROM SCRATCH.

First inspect the existing codebase, framework, routes, components, Firebase configuration, Firestore collections, authentication, existing features and design system.

Preserve all existing working features and existing customer data. Improve and extend the existing implementation. Do not unnecessarily change the existing application structure or remove functional modules.

If an existing feature already works, integrate it into the new architecture instead of creating a duplicate.

